        <updated>2026-08-06T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<div class="framer-ha51i5"><div class="framer-ofrl85" data-framer-name="Date" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-19mrzvl" data-styles-preset="owxKmM_AB" dir="auto"><time datetime="2026-08-06T00:00:00.000Z">August 6, 2026</time></p></div><div class="framer-1l31t3m"><div class="framer-kr87dh" data-framer-name="Text"><div class="framer-h6ngu5" data-framer-name="Title" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none"><h1 class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-12enf0" data-styles-preset="OOrZpFnN1" dir="auto">Building a Live Attack Graph: From Static PDFs to Replayable Context</h1></div><div class="framer-irmd52" data-framer-name="Author" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none"><p dir="auto" class="framer-text"><strong class="framer-text">Sina Khoraman</strong></p><p dir="auto" class="framer-text">Software Engineer</p></div></div><div class="framer-pcmr0" data-framer-name="Text"><div class="framer-1mwka6l" data-framer-name="Summary" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-r1o8bn" data-styles-preset="EU3yPoH0k" dir="auto">Point-in-time pentests fail to capture the dynamic reality of modern IT environments. By combining a time-traveling Data Plane with an explainable Control Plane, NRDSNIPE turns messy security data into a replayable, context-rich model for autonomous testing.</p></div><div class="framer-1215yx5" data-framer-name="Read more" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-r1o8bn" data-styles-preset="EU3yPoH0k" dir="auto"><strong class="framer-text">➔ Read more</strong></p></div></div></div></div><div class="ssr-variant"><div class="framer-5w25o5-container"><div class="framer-w4CEg framer-1vdlvve framer-v-1nta5da" data-framer-name="No padding" style="width: